{
 "description": "Evaluate an OpenSea EVM NFT trait-snipe candidate using caller-supplied fresh listings, trait floor, max price, minimum discount, recent real trait sales, and trait volume gates. Returns BUY/PASS plus an unsigned local-only buy intent. Never signs, submits, broadcasts, or treats rarity metadata alone as evidence.",
